url: "https://github.com/kazuru-chidumbwe/sipdrift"
abstract: >-
  Differential testing harness for SIP message handling. A pinned fixture
  corpus is run through multiple stack drivers; observations are normalized
  onto shared oracle axes and classified as agree, diverge, error, or skip.
  Stub drivers support CI without native SIP libraries; optional lab drivers
  exercise PJSIP, Sofia-SIP, and Kamailio on a host-pinned lab path.
keywords:
